        <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
          <name>DecorationHowToConnectComponent</name>
          <id>48</id>
          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>To use the screenshot add-in:
1. Download the latest version of the AddIn.dll file from the &lt;link https://github.com/lintest/VanessaExt/releases>developer repository &lt;/>
2. Connect it with the &quot;WindowsControl&quot; ID (will be copied to the clipboard) in &lt;link e1cib/list/Catalog.External components>the list of add-ins&lt;/>. When connecting, specify the version number specified in the &lt;link https://github.com/lintest/VanessaExt/releases>repository&lt;/>. In the name, specify &quot;Vanessa&quot;, for example
3 Make sure the add-in is enabled</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>برای استفاده از افزونه تصویر صفحه:
1. آخرین نسخه فایل AddIn.dll را از &lt;link https://github.com/lintest/VanessaExt/releases>مخزن توسعه‌دهنده &lt;/> دانلود کنید
2. آن را با شناسه &quot;WindowsControl&quot; (که در حافظه موقت کپی خواهد شد) در &lt;link e1cib/list/Catalog.External components>فهرست افزونه‌ها&lt;/> متصل کنید. هنگام اتصال، شماره نسخه مشخص‌شده در &lt;link https://github.com/lintest/VanessaExt/releases>مخزن&lt;/> را وارد کنید. در نام، برای مثال &quot;Vanessa&quot; را وارد کنید
3 اطمینان حاصل کنید که افزونه فعال است</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>Для использования компоненты получения скриншотов необходимо:
1. Скачать файл AddIn.dll последней версии с &lt;link https://github.com/lintest/VanessaExt/releases>репозитория разработчика &lt;/>
2. Подключить её с идентификатором &quot;WindowsControl&quot; (будет скопирован в буфер обмена) в &lt;link e1cib/list/Catalog.External components>списке внешних компонент&lt;/>. При подключении указать номер версии, указанный в &lt;link https://github.com/lintest/VanessaExt/releases>репозитории&lt;/>. В наименовании указать например &quot;Vanessa&quot;
3  Убедиться что внешняя компонента включена</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>Ekran görüntüsü alma eklentisini kullanmak için yapılması gerekenler:
1. AddIn.dll dosyasının en son sürümünü &lt;link https://github.com/lintest/VanessaExt/releases>репозитория разработчика &lt;/> üzerinden indirin
2. Bunu &lt;link e1cib/list/Catalog.External components>harici eklentiler listesinde&lt;/> &quot;WindowsControl&quot; kimliğiyle (panoya kopyalanacaktır) bağlayın. Bağlantı sırasında, &lt;link https://github.com/lintest/VanessaExt/releases>репозитории&lt;/> adresinde belirtilen sürüm numarasını belirtin. Tanım belirtin, örnek olarak &quot;Vanessa&quot;
3. Harici eklentinin açık olduğundan emin olun</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>Để sử dụng cấu phần nhận ảnh chụp màn hình, cần:
1. Tải tệp AddIn.dll của phiên bản cuối cùng từ &lt;link https://github.com/lintest/VanessaExt/releases>kho lưu trữ của nhà phát triển &lt;/>
2. Kết nối kho lưu trữ với tên định danh &quot;WindowsControl&quot; (sẽ sao chép vào bộ đệm trao đổi) trong &lt;link e1cib/list/Catalog.External components> danh sách các cấu phần ngoài&lt;/>. Khi kết nối chỉ ra số phiên bản mà được chỉ ra trong &lt;link https://github.com/lintest/VanessaExt/releases>kho lưu trữ&lt;/>. Trong tên gọi, chỉ ra ví dụ &quot;Vanessa&quot;
3  Hãy chắc chắn rằng, đã bật sử dụng cấu phần ngoài</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>To use the screenshot add-in:
1. Download the latest version of the AddIn.dll file from the &lt;link https://github.com/lintest/VanessaExt/releases>developer repository &lt;/>
2. Connect it with the &quot;WindowsControl&quot; ID (will be copied to the clipboard) in &lt;link e1cib/list/Catalog.External components>the list of add-ins&lt;/>. When connecting, specify the version number specified in the &lt;link https://github.com/lintest/VanessaExt/releases>repository&lt;/>. In the name, specify &quot;Vanessa&quot;, for example
3 Make sure the add-in is enabled</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>To use the screenshot add-in:
1. Download the latest version of the AddIn.dll file from the &lt;link https://github.com/lintest/VanessaExt/releases>developer repository &lt;/>
2. Connect it with the &quot;WindowsControl&quot; ID (will be copied to the clipboard) in &lt;link e1cib/list/Catalog.External components>the list of add-ins&lt;/>. When connecting, specify the version number specified in the &lt;link https://github.com/lintest/VanessaExt/releases>repository&lt;/>. In the name, specify &quot;Vanessa&quot;, for example
3 Make sure the add-in is enabled</value>
          </title>
          <visible>true</visible>
          <enabled>true</enabled>
          <userVisible>
            <common>true</common>
          </userVisible>
          <extendedTooltip>
            <name>DecorationHowToConnectComponentExtendedTooltip</name>
            <id>50</id>
            <type>Label</type>
            <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
            <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
            <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
              <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
            </extInfo>
          </extendedTooltip>
